{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hatched in the depths of cyberspace, every Nanomon needs a tamer This is your chance to raise a pet monster from the safety of your desktop! From Magical Cats, to Retro Dragons, there\u2019s a Nanomon to match everyone\u2019s style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/NAN_Graphic_Steam_GIF-Evolve_616x100_V2.gif?t=1750301420\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your skill as a tamer will determine whether your monster becomes the STRONGEST, the FASTEST, or maybe just the best watermelon farmer in the Nanoscape? Use your trusty Guide Book to help your Nanomon reach its full potential! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/NAN_Graphic_Steam_GIF-Battle_616x100_V2.gif?t=1750301420\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wanna be the very best? You wanna be a legend? Then hone your Nanomon into a fierce fighter! Battle your friends online, duking it out with your best Nanomon, see who has what it takes to win! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/NAN_Graphic_Steam_GIF-Play_616x100_V3.gif?t=1750301420\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hard at work? Or hardly working? Nanomon has you covered either way. You can dive into a dungeon, head out fishing, or just play ball with your Nano-pal. When you need a break, they\u2019re always down to have a nap at Home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/NAN_Graphic_Steam_GIF-Discover_616x100_V2.gif?t=1750301420\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Nanoscape is a massive world that fits into a tiny window! The secrets of the Nanoscape are yours to uncover! Exploring ever-changing biomes, feeding them new foods, and\u2026 cleaning up its business. Nanomon are curious and ready to roll, so prepare for adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1498060?t=1750301420","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/403019b26f94d2b82602aead376ced791605ccba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750301420","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/2baeb721cc68e6d764ebe5248289541bb2f1c155/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750301420","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/2baeb721cc68e6d764ebe5248289541bb2f1c155/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750301420","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2018680,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/NAN_Graphic_Steam_FeaturesBanner_616x100_V2.png?t=1750301420\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\ud83e\udd5a Raise a unique Nanomon in the style of classic digital pet games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf56 Feed them exotic foods to discover new evolutions </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udded Uncover the Nanoscape, inspired by Adventure Time, Digimon, and Tamagotchi </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa3 Play games with your Nanomon like Fishing, Stick-ball, and Dungeon-diving </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd4a Fight in fast-paced battles while exploring the world</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hatched in the depths of cyberspace, every Nanomon needs a tamer This is your chance to raise a pet monster from the safety of your desktop! From Magical Cats, to Retro Dragons, there\u2019s a Nanomon to match everyone\u2019s style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/NAN_Graphic_Steam_GIF-Evolve_616x100_V2.gif?t=1750301420\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your skill as a tamer will determine whether your monster becomes the STRONGEST, the FASTEST, or maybe just the best watermelon farmer in the Nanoscape? Use your trusty Guide Book to help your Nanomon reach its full potential! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/NAN_Graphic_Steam_GIF-Battle_616x100_V2.gif?t=1750301420\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wanna be the very best? You wanna be a legend? Then hone your Nanomon into a fierce fighter! Battle your friends online, duking it out with your best Nanomon, see who has what it takes to win! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/NAN_Graphic_Steam_GIF-Play_616x100_V3.gif?t=1750301420\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hard at work? Or hardly working? Nanomon has you covered either way. You can dive into a dungeon, head out fishing, or just play ball with your Nano-pal. When you need a break, they\u2019re always down to have a nap at Home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/extras/NAN_Graphic_Steam_GIF-Discover_616x100_V2.gif?t=1750301420\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Nanoscape is a massive world that fits into a tiny window! The secrets of the Nanoscape are yours to uncover! Exploring ever-changing biomes, feeding them new foods, and\u2026 cleaning up its business. Nanomon are curious and ready to roll, so prepare for adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Oscar Brittain"],"dlc":[3769510],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498060/header.jpg?t=1750301420","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Oscar Brittain","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 14+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 700 Series<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 10.14+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 700 Series<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1080p display</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257046347,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257046347/movie480.mp4?t=1748968802","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257046347/movie_max.mp4?t=1748968802"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257046347/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1748968802","webm":{